        <mxCell id="legend-title" parent="legend-container" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="계층별 흐름 · 설정 · 로그  (mc-deploy 실측 · 2026-09-17)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="24" width="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="36" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-badge-legend" parent="step-1-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-1-desc-legend" parent="step-1-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;① 사용자 → Route 53&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;petclinic.mission-critical.site A/AAAA alias → CloudFront E2PWXW3LUYTDEE (가비아 NS 위임). ALB DNS 는 공개하지 않음&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="142" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-badge-legend" parent="step-2-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="2" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-2-desc-legend" parent="step-2-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;① CloudFront (WAF · ACM 부착)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;WAF 는 별도 홉이 아니라 CloudFront 에 붙은 Web ACL(us-east-1): 캐시 조회보다 먼저 평가, 차단은 캐시·오리진 미도달. 규칙 = allow-loadgen(JMeter IP set) → 관리형 3(IP 평판·Common·KnownBadInputs) → rate-all IP당 5분 2,000 → rate-booking /visits/new 100. 로그 → CloudWatch Logs aws-waf-logs-mc. 멘토링 '관리 어려움' 의견은 있었으나 팀 결정으로 유지(enable_waf=true). ACM us-east-1 · TLSv1.2_2021 · HTTP→HTTPS. 액세스 로그 → S3 mc-logs/cloudfront/ 90일&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="248" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-badge-legend" parent="step-3-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="3" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-3-desc-legend" parent="step-3-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;① Behavior 분기 → 정적 S3 / ALB / 점검 S3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;오리진 3개. /static/* · /images/*(랜딩 css·이미지·hero 영상) = S3 mc-static(OAC) — apply 가 저장소 src/main/webapp/resources·images 를 동기화, CachingOptimized 1일 → Hit 면 엣지, Miss 면 S3(Apache 안 거침). /petclinic/resources/* · /petclinic/images/*(WAR 안) = ALB 캐시. 동적 * = CachingDisabled + AllViewer → 매번 ALB. /maintenance.html = 점검 S3 OAC, 오리진 5xx → 503. 정적 교체 후 invalidation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="354" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-badge-legend" parent="step-4-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-4-desc-legend" parent="step-4-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;② Public ALB → WEB ×2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;SG = CloudFront origin-facing 프리픽스 443 만(1차) · 리스너 기본 403 · X-Origin-Verify 일치 시만 mc-tg-web(2차). 80 리스너 없음. 헬스체크 /health.html 10s·5s·2/3(얕게). EC2 고정 2대 — ASG 는 로드맵. 액세스 로그 → S3 mc-logs/alb&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="460" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-badge-legend" parent="step-5-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="5" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-5-desc-legend" parent="step-5-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;② WEB → Internal ALB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;Apache 2.4 mod_proxy_http(mod_jk 아님 — AJP 는 ALB 통과 불가). / = test 브랜치 WAR 의 index.html + resources·images 를 /var/www/html/static 으로 복사해 직접 서빙, /petclinic/ → 302 /(hero 1회). ProxyPass /petclinic/ → :8080 · ProxyPreserveHost On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="566" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-badge-legend" parent="step-6-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="6" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-6-desc-legend" parent="step-6-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;③ Internal ALB → WAS ×2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;mc-alb-internal :8080 → mc-tg-was /petclinic/ 10s·2/3. SG 체인 sg-alb-internal 8080 ← sg-web · sg-was 8080 ← sg-alb-internal. WEB 은 WAS IP 를 모름 → 교체·증설 시 WEB 무변경. Tomcat 9.0.121 · Corretto 8 · test(Green, Spring 5.3.39)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="672" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-badge-legend" parent="step-7-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="7" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-7-desc-legend" parent="step-7-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;③→④ WAS → RDS Proxy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;부팅 시 Secrets Manager app-db(petclinic_app) 조회 → mvnw -P MySQL -Djdbc.* 빌드 주입(Java 0줄). JDBC sslMode=REQUIRED → Proxy require_tls. tomcat-jdbc 풀 testOnBorrow · 유휴 10분 회수(Proxy idle 30분 대비). was.sh: Proxy 로그인 성공까지 대기, 404 면 재시작&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="778" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-badge-legend" parent="step-8-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="8" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-8-desc-legend" parent="step-8-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;④ RDS Multi-AZ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;mc-petclinic MySQL 8.4.11 · db.t3.small · Primary 2c / Standby 2a 동기 복제(RPO 0) · failover 60~120s 엔드포인트 동일 · 파라미터 그룹 mc-mysql84 require_secure_transport=1 · SG 3306 ← sg-rds-proxy 만. Spring initialize-database → vets 6 · owners 10 · pets 13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-9-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="884" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-9-badge-legend" parent="step-9-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="9" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-9-desc-legend" parent="step-9-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;④ Secrets ×2 · KMS · Backup&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;admin 비밀(rds!db-…)은 7일 자동 교체 → 앱이 쓰면 교체 때 끊김 → 앱 전용 petclinic_app 비밀(교체 없음) 추가, Proxy 인증 2개. Backup mc-rds-daily 04:00 KST 7일 + PITR. KMS alias/mc-cmk = S3·SNS·Logs·Backup, RDS·비밀은 AWS 관리형 키&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-10-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="990" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-10-badge-legend" parent="step-10-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="10" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-10-desc-legend" parent="step-10-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;계층별 로그 = 서버에 두지 않음&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;CloudWatch Logs 는 계정에 1개(VPC 밖 · 자체 저장소) — 로그 그룹만 /mc/web/* · /mc/was/* · /mc/bastion/secure · /aws/rds/instance/mc-petclinic/{error,slowquery} · /aws/rds/proxy/mc-rds-proxy(30일 · KMS) · aws-waf-logs-mc(us-east-1) 로 나눔, 스트림 = 인스턴스 ID. WEB·WAS·Bastion 은 Agent, RDS·Proxy 는 서비스 내보내기. 장기 보관은 구독 필터 → Firehose(계층당 1개 · 5분 gzip) → S3 mc-logs/cwlogs/‹tier›/ 1년(9/17). ALB·CloudFront 는 서비스가 직접 S3 객체. Agent 설정은 Parameter Store /mc/cwagent/* 에서 부팅 시 받음(파라미터 그룹은 DB TLS 강제·슬로우 쿼리 로그 스위치)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-11-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="1096" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-11-badge-legend" parent="step-11-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="11" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-11-desc-legend" parent="step-11-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;감사 로그 (계정 수준)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;CloudTrail mc-trail(다중 리전 · 관리 이벤트 · 로그 파일 검증) → S3 mc-cloudtrail 1년(90일 후 Glacier IR). 서버·VPC 와 무관하게 AWS API 호출 기록. was-a 장애는 서버 접속 없이 /mc/was/catalina 로 원인 확인&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-12-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="1202" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-12-badge-legend" parent="step-12-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="12" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-12-desc-legend" parent="step-12-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;관측 · 알림 (공통)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;CloudWatch 알람 3(was-unhealthy-host · alb-p95 &amp;gt;2s · rds-connections &amp;gt;60) → SNS mc-alerts, 이메일 구독 0건(alert_emails 한 줄). Grafana(enable_grafana=false) · Slack · ASG 대상 추적은 회색 로드맵&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-13-legend" connectable="0" parent="legend-container" style="group;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="600" y="1308" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-13-badge-legend" parent="step-13-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#007CBD;strokeColor=default;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;shadow=1;glass=0;strokeWidth=2;" value="13" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="38" width="40" y="2" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="step-13-desc-legend" parent="step-13-legend" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;② ③ 운영자 접속 = Bastion (SSM 안 씀)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt; &lt;/b&gt;팀 결정 9/16: 퍼블릭 서브넷 A 의 Bastion(t3.micro · EIP) 에 SSH 22 — 허용은 운영자 공인 IP /32 만(base.bastion_allowed_cidrs). 키 mc-ssh 하나를 Bastion·WEB·WAS 에 부착 → ssh -J 로 점프, DB 는 Bastion 에서 mysql --ssl → RDS Proxy 3306. Session Manager 문서·/mc/ssm 로그·SSM Core 정책은 제거(enable_ssm=false). sshd 로그 → /mc/bastion/secure. NAT ×2 는 아웃바운드 전용(AZ 손실 대비)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="548" x="52" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-note" parent="legend-container" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;회색 점선 = 로드맵(ASG · Grafana · Slack). 모서리 작은 아이콘(WAF · ACM)은 CloudFront 에 부착된 기능이며 트래픽 경로 아님. NAT·IGW 는 흐름 번호 없음. Blue(main · Tomcat 9.0.53) 복귀는 tfvars 2줄. Primary/Standby AZ 는 failover 시 바뀜(9/16 실측 Primary 2c).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="44" width="600" y="1420" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
