        <mxCell id="lg-d-1" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Internal ALB (깊게)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0,0,0), rgb(255,255,255));&quot;&gt;tg-was 헬스체크 /petclinic/(슬래시 필수, 302 방지) 10s·2/3, 등록 취소 30s. PetClinic은 stateless라 sticky 불필요&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=12;labelBackgroundColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lg-1">
          <mxGeometry x="48" width="508" height="96" as="geometry" />
